    **calibration_transfer.LABELS,
    **community_transfer.LABELS,
    **receptor_transfer.LABELS, **conservation_transfer.LABELS,
    **customer_review_transfer.LABELS, **terrain_transfer.LABELS, **management_transfer.LABELS,
